quest_expr:(aa+bb*x+cc*x^3)/(x);
/*worked solution variables*/
soln1:((aa/x)+(bb*x/x)-(cc*x^3/x));
/*applying linearity*/
sol2:int(aa/x,x);
soln3:int(bb*x/x,x);
soln4:int(cc*x^3/x,x);
ta:sol2+soln3+soln4+c;</text>
